    {
      "id": "53DF5123BEF237D9",
      "title": "&f&lYour first ME network&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the project described below.",
        "",
        "&fBegin with power input, a terminal, a drive and a small storage cell. Add automation only after you can insert and retrieve materials reliably. The native network’s energy and channel rules still apply.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fKeep frequently used ingredients in the network and a small recovery reserve outside it.",
        "",
        "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "1289DCCC86D7A75C",
