    {
      "id": "01EFDAD513378219",
      "title": "&f&lFeed only what a machine needs&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the project described below.",
        "",
        "&fKeep background production and on-demand production distinct. A permanent supply line can fill a buffer; a request-based line should return precisely the expected result to the network.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fReserve some basic materials so a request does not consume all of your startup stock.",
        "",
        "&7Activity check · Mark this after completing the described project.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
      ],
